Dear Nudge Engineering Team,

Building India's ultimate commerce rewards platform across a unified *Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP)* and *Compose Multiplatform* codebase represents a forward-looking mobile architecture. Engineering physical receipt scanning, automated digital invoice ingestion, and real-time gamified rewards requires cross-platform systems discipline and locked 60 FPS UI rendering. Having shipped production client apps across *Kotlin*, *Compose Multiplatform*, *Koin*, and *Room KMP*, my background directly matches Nudge's technical roadmap.

At *LexoLegal*, I architected a cross-platform legal case management client across Android (*Android SDK*) and iOS in *Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP)* and *Compose Multiplatform*, structuring an adaptive shell on *Navigation 3*, *Koin DI*, and *Room KMP* with *85%+ code sharing* across 168 unit tests. At *Webxela*, I shipped Coupit, a cross-platform loyalty client in *Compose Multiplatform (CMP)* featuring a *60 FPS* physics-driven Canvas spin wheel and dynamic QR vouchers via *Firebase Cloud Messaging*. In open source, I authored *Oak*, a KMP library targeting Android, iOS, and the JVM that implements *Clean Architecture* and multi-engine *Ktor* abstractions to normalize catalog data across major e-commerce platforms.

Robust client engineering requires handling intermittent connectivity, hardware variations, and explicit UI state trees. In *WatchTower*, I optimized background crawls via *Kotlin Coroutines* with semaphore rate limiting and *WorkManager*, pairing reactive *Room* Flow observables with *OkHttp* while locking UI frames at *60 FPS*. Furthermore, daily proficiency with AI developer tools like *Claude Code* and *Cursor* allows me to rapidly scaffold Composable layouts, synthesize test suites, and debug regressions while maintaining strict architectural ownership over every line.

Joining Nudge as a Software Engineering Intern (Client / Mobile) provides the high-growth environment where my cross-platform Kotlin expertise and UI polish can accelerate feature velocity. I am available for full-time on-site work at your Bangalore Corporate Office and welcome the opportunity to walk through my apps.

